.SH NAME
voltkit\-shortcut\-guide \- Show a cheat sheet of the keyboard shortcuts
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBvoltkit shortcut\-guide\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show a cheat sheet of the keyboard shortcuts
.PP
Lists the system\-wide shortcuts by who owns them, plus the ones most apps share. Type to find one, press Esc to close. Works on GNOME and the desktops built like it.
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
